OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves predicted to cost London
OL,4,A#25bn in decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FContinued heatwaves in London could
OL,7,Fcost the capital more than #25bn over
OL,8,Fthe next decade, the city's mayor Lord
OL,9,FKhan has warned.
OL,11,FCity Hall has estimated the cost of
OL,12,Flost productivity, as analysis revealed
OL,13,FLondon's 2026 heatwaves alone cost
OL,14,Fabout #2.5bn.
OL,16,FLondon's mayor is expected to call on
OL,17,Fglobal leaders at COP31 in Antalya to
OL,18,Fstep up action to tackle the climate
OL,19,Femergency and protect cities from
OL,20,Fextreme temperatures.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
